# Typography

## Fonts

| Role | Family | Tailwind |
|------|--------|----------|
| Body / UI | DM Sans | `font-sans` |
| Headings / brand | **Fraunces** | `font-heading` |

Tokens in `src/global.css`:

```css
@theme {
  --font-sans: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  --font-heading: "Fraunces", serif;
}
```

Loaded via Google Fonts in `index.html`.

## Rules

- Titles, brand name, hero/page headings → `font-heading` (Fraunces)
- Body text, forms, labels, tables → `font-sans` (DM Sans)
- Do not introduce other font families
- Do not hardcode `font-family` inline; use theme tokens / Tailwind classes

## ✅ GOOD

```tsx
<h1 className="font-heading text-4xl font-bold">…</h1>
<p className="font-sans text-base">…</p>
```
